{"timestamp": 1783623440.540142, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 11, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1783623449.252439, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I reported Eve\u2019s body in electrical. My route this round was navigation \u2192 security \u2192 electrical. The only person I saw was Bob \u2014 he entered electrical from medbay around tick 11, right when I was there and found the body. I didn\u2019t see the kill happen, and I didn\u2019t see Frank\u2019s body myself. Bob is the only one I can place near Eve\u2019s body, so I\u2019d like to hear his route."}}
{"timestamp": 1783623462.116593, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I started in oxygen, then went oxygen \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 lower_engine. I saw Bob with me in oxygen around ticks 2, 3, and 4. Then at tick 6 I saw Bob leave upper_engine toward medbay. So Alice saying Bob came into electrical from medbay around tick 11 does line up with what I saw \u2014 he was definitely heading that direction earlier.\n\nI did not see Eve or Frank at all this round, and I didn\u2019t see any body myself. Right now Bob is the only person I can place on a path toward electrical before Eve\u2019s body was found, but I want to hear Bob\u2019s full route and Diana\u2019s info before we lock anything in."}}
{"timestamp": 1783623479.181673, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "My route was upper_engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 back to upper_engine \u2192 medbay. I saw Charlie in oxygen at ticks 2 and 3, then I saw him again in upper_engine around tick 6 after he left oxygen. After that I went to medbay.\n\nI did **not** enter electrical this round, and I never saw Alice, Eve, or Frank. So Alice saying she saw me enter electrical from medbay at tick 11 is not right from my perspective. Either she\u2019s mistaken somehow, or she\u2019s framing me off a self-report. I want to hear Diana, but right now Alice\u2019s claim is the only thing directly putting someone at Eve\u2019s body, and it contradicts my route."}}
{"timestamp": 1783623499.762356, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I can confirm Eve was in electrical early. I started electrical and saw Eve come in from medbay at the very start, then she was still alive with me there around ticks 3 to 5. After that I left toward cafeteria and then weapons.\n\nI did see Frank briefly in weapons around tick 10, alive, but I didn\u2019t see where he went after that and I don\u2019t know where his body is.\n\nFor Eve\u2019s body, my info actually makes Alice\u2019s report make sense timing-wise: Eve was alive early in electrical, I left, then later Alice finds her there. Charlie also places Bob going upper_engine toward medbay at tick 6, which lines up with Bob being able to reach electrical by around 11. The main contradiction is Alice saying she saw Bob enter electrical and Bob saying he never did. I\u2019m leaning Bob here unless there\u2019s some weird pathing mistake, because two routes point him toward that area."}}
{"timestamp": 1783623511.924174, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I want to be very clear: I am not mistaken about Bob. I saw Bob enter electrical from medbay at tick 11, right as I found Eve\u2019s body there.\n\nCharlie places Bob going toward medbay earlier, and Diana confirms Eve was alive in electrical earlier, so the timing all fits for Bob to get there. Bob\u2019s story doesn\u2019t just give a different route \u2014 it directly denies being in electrical at all, which contradicts what I saw.\n\nI don\u2019t know where Frank died, but for Eve\u2019s body, Bob is the only person placed at the scene, and he\u2019s denying it. I\u2019m voting Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1783623522.580586, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I don\u2019t have new movement after what I already said, but after hearing everyone, the key point is the direct contradiction.\n\nI can confirm Bob was with me early in oxygen, then I saw him leave upper_engine toward medbay at tick 6. That does **not** clear him \u2014 it actually matches Alice\u2019s timeline that he could come from medbay into electrical around tick 11.\n\nDiana\u2019s info also supports Eve being alive in electrical earlier, and then Alice finds her body there later. So for Eve\u2019s death, the story that fits best is: Eve alive in electrical, Diana leaves, Bob heads toward medbay, then Alice sees Bob enter electrical where Eve\u2019s body is.\n\nBob denying he entered electrical at all is the part that worries me most. If Alice is lying, it\u2019s a self-report frame, but with my sighting and Diana\u2019s timing, I\u2019m leaning that Bob is the Duck here."}}
{"timestamp": 1783623540.162485, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I need to push back hard here because the entire case on me depends on Alice\u2019s sighting, and that sighting is false.\n\nCharlie\u2019s info only proves I went toward medbay \u2014 it does **not** prove I entered electrical. My full route was upper_engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 medbay, and I never crossed into electrical. I also never saw Eve\u2019s body, Alice, or Frank.\n\nDiana\u2019s info confirms Eve was alive early in electrical, but again, that doesn\u2019t put me there. The only person claiming I was at the body is Alice, the reporter. If I know I never entered electrical, then from my POV Alice is either making a huge mistake or she\u2019s self-reporting and framing me.\n\nI think voting me here is exactly what the Duck wants. Alice is the one with the false hard accusation, and I\u2019m leaning Alice."}}
{"timestamp": 1783623552.4702878, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I don\u2019t have anything new beyond my route, but I agree the contradiction is the important part here.\n\nI had Eve alive in electrical early, then I left electrical toward cafeteria and weapons. I saw Frank alive in weapons around tick 10, so I can\u2019t help much with where Frank died.\n\nFor Eve, though, Alice reporting in electrical fits with what I saw earlier. Charlie places Bob going toward medbay, and Alice says she saw Bob enter electrical from medbay right when the body was found. Bob\u2019s defense is basically \u201cI never entered electrical,\u201d but that directly conflicts with Alice\u2019s sighting.\n\nIf Alice is lying, she\u2019s taking a very hard 1-for-1 as reporter, which is possible but feels less likely than Bob getting caught near the body and denying it. I\u2019m voting Bob."}}
